\title{cvr: Polygonal Coverage Operations via GEOS}
\description{
Bindings to the GEOS coverage API: topology-preserving simplification of polygonal coverages, coverage validation, and coverage union. These are set-level operators that consume a whole vector of polygons as one coverage and return a result parallel to it, so shared edges are simplified once and stay edge-matched in both neighbours. Geometry is exchanged as well-known binary, so any 'wk' compatible vector is accepted and returned. Requires GEOS 3.12.0 or later.
